HPA vllm-token-throughput

HPA control loop
  minReplicas 1, maxReplicas 8
  metric tokens_per_second (Pods/AverageValue): target 350 <- simulated rate of generation_tokens_total
  metric vllm:num_requests_waiting (Pods/AverageValue): target 2 <- simulated requests_waiting
  behavior (after API defaulting)
    scaleUp: stabilizationWindow 0s, selectPolicy Max
      - Pods 4 per 15s
      - Percent 100 per 15s
    scaleDown: stabilizationWindow 300s, selectPolicy Max
      - Percent 50 per 60s
  tolerance: scale up 0.1, scale down 0.1; sync period 15s (controller defaults unless overridden by flags)
